<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 629)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Updates are offered at launch.</b> Asobi now checks for a new build every time it starts, and every hour while it runs, and offers it as soon as one exists. Nothing appears when you are already current.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
